# Test do macro with three binding steps
# NOTE: The `=== warn: undefined variable: result` is correct.
# At typecheck time, `result` is undefined. The do macro expands at eval time,
# resolving `result` to the monad dictionary via macro expansion.
[do result
  [x: [Ok 1]]
  [y: [Ok 2]]
  [Ok [+ x y]]]
=== out
Variant(Ok, Int(3))

=== warn
undefined variable: Ok at 5:8-5:10
undefined variable: Ok at 6:8-6:10
undefined variable: Ok at 7:4-7:6
